cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DiscoVista-Next in your research, please cite this software
  together with the original DiscoVista paper listed under references.
title: >-
  DiscoVista-Next: phylogenetic discordance visualization and analysis in
  Python 3
abstract: >-
  DiscoVista-Next is a Python 3 rewrite of DiscoVista that removes the R
  dependency of the original tool. It provides six analysis modes for
  phylogenetic discordance (species tree discordance, gene tree discordance,
  GC content, occupancy, branch support versus branch length, and relative
  frequency), a qt-material based graphical interface with 26 themes and
  Chinese/English switching, a command-line interface compatible with the
  original argument format, and PyInstaller packaging support.
